sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor S as Shopper
participant W as Web App
participant G as API Gateway
participant A as Auth Service
participant C as Cart Service
participant P as Pricing Service
participant I as Inventory Service
participant ID as Inventory DB
participant O as Order Service
participant OD as Orders DB
participant F as Fraud Service
participant Pay as Payment Service
participant CN as Card Network (ext)
participant ACS as Issuer ACS (ext)
participant B as Event Bus
participant E as Email Service
participant WH as Warehouse System (ext)
Note over S,WH: Rules: every call carries a correlation id. Card data never touches Web App (tokenised by Payment Service). Reservations expire after 15 min.

rect rgb(235,243,255)
Note over S,A: Login phase
S->>W: Open checkout
W->>G: Session token
G->>A: Validate token
alt valid
A-->>G: user id
else 401
A-->>G: 401
G-->>W: 401
W-->>S: Show login page
loop up to 3 attempts
S->>W: Submit credentials
W->>A: Check credentials
A-->>W: New token
end
Note over A: After 3 failures account locks 15 min
end
end

rect rgb(235,255,240)
Note over W,ID: Cart phase
W->>C: Get cart
loop each line item
C->>P: Current price and promotions
P-->>C: Price
end
opt voucher present
C->>C: Apply voucher
end
C->>C: Recalculate totals
C-->>W: Cart
C->>I: Reserve stock
I->>ID: Write reservation (TTL 15 min)
alt all in stock
I-->>C: Reserved
else out of stock
I-->>C: Shortage
C-->>W: Shortage
W-->>S: Remove or back-order item?
end
end

rect rgb(255,248,230)
Note over W,F: Order phase
W->>G: Post order (idempotency key)
G->>O: Create order
O->>O: Check idempotency key
O->>OD: Write order PENDING
O->>F: Risk score (amount, device, IP, history)
F-->>O: Score
alt score < 300
Note over O: Proceed
else 300 to 700
Note over O: Require 3-D Secure
else score > 700
O->>OD: Order rejected
O->>I: Release reservation
I->>ID: Delete reservation
O-->>W: Rejected
end
end

rect rgb(255,238,238)
Note over O,ACS: Payment phase
O->>Pay: Authorise amount
loop retry timeouts, max 2, exponential backoff
Pay->>CN: Authorisation (tokenised card)
end
opt 3-D Secure required
CN-->>Pay: Challenge URL
Pay-->>O: Challenge URL
O-->>W: Challenge URL
W-->>S: Redirect to Issuer ACS
S->>ACS: Complete challenge
ACS-->>CN: Result
end
CN-->>Pay: Authorisation result
alt approved
Pay-->>O: Auth code
else declined
Pay-->>O: Decline reason
O->>OD: Order FAILED
O->>I: Release reservation
I->>ID: Delete reservation
O-->>W: Error
W-->>S: Show error
end
end

rect rgb(243,238,255)
Note over O,WH: Confirmation phase (on approval)
O->>OD: Order CONFIRMED
O->>I: Commit reservation
I->>ID: Decrement stock
O-)B: Publish OrderConfirmed
B-)E: OrderConfirmed
E->>S: Confirmation email
B-)WH: OrderConfirmed
WH->>WH: Create pick list
WH-)B: Shipped (tracking number)
B-)O: Shipped
O->>OD: Update order
B-)E: Shipped
E->>S: Shipping notice
O-->>W: Order number
W-->>S: Confirmation page
end
